        "created_at": "2011-12-15T19:51:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah Omnitron is definitely the easiest in my opinion!  We wanted there to be some villains in the core set that are easy for new players just getting into the game.  Definitely try advanced mode, as well as the trickier villains, for some more scaling <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Also!  Given the significant positive response we heard on the Kickstarter to the idea of an alternate Baron Blade, it is possible we’ll incorporate that idea and/or an alternate Omnitron into some sort of future release.</p>",
